  "id": "attachment-based-intervention",
  "term": "attachment-based intervention",
  "definition": "An attachment-based intervention is a mental health intervention designed to strengthen attachment security in infants. In this packet, it refers to an approach being studied to see whether it has specific effects on infant attachment security and related maternal and child outcomes.",
